 "tags": [
  {
   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Developer Connect API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Connections, Git repository links and account connectors are configuration metadata: no Git provider, GitHub App, OAuth flow, webhook or Git proxy is contacted or created, and installation state, webhook IDs and proxy URIs are not reported. Credentials must be Secret Manager version names, which are stored as references and never resolved. Custom OAuth client secrets and enabling a proxy are refused, and only labels, annotations and disabled can be updated. Deleting a connection that still has Git repository links fails with FAILED_PRECONDITION. Long-running operations complete synchronously.",
   "name": "Developer Connect"
  }
 ],
